Microsoft Visual Studio Code built-in Dark / Dark+ theme portions
================================================================

The dark section of default.min.css is a modified partial adaptation of
Microsoft Visual Studio Code's built-in Dark / Dark+ themes. Adaptation and
local styling by DarkTrick. The highlight.js Default theme has its own BSD
notice in ../LICENSE; this notice applies to Microsoft-derived portions only.

The exact upstream revision originally copied is unknown. Verified historical
reference (not a claim identifying the originally copied release):
  microsoft/vscode 1.60.0
  commit e7d7e9a9348e6a8cc8c03f877d39cb72e5dfb1ff
  extensions/theme-defaults/themes/dark_vs.json
  extensions/theme-defaults/themes/dark_plus.json
  extensions/theme-defaults/package.json (declares MIT)
  https://github.com/microsoft/vscode/tree/e7d7e9a9348e6a8cc8c03f877d39cb72e5dfb1ff/extensions/theme-defaults
  https://github.com/microsoft/vscode/blob/e7d7e9a9348e6a8cc8c03f877d39cb72e5dfb1ff/LICENSE.txt

